description:
Remove a tag from one of your Nekoweb sites. Use nekoweb_get_tags to see the current tags.

Requires the optional session token (NEKOWEB_SESSION_TOKEN). If it isn't set, this tool returns setup steps to pass on to the user. Tag changes are rate limited to about 20 per 15 minutes.

Example: "Remove the windows tag" -> { tag: "windows" }
